        <activityName xml:lang="en">Acetylene, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Acetylene, at regional storehouse
theoretical data from process analysis. Only the most important flows are taken into account. Electricity demand is estimated. Not to be used for systems where acetylene plays an important role.;
CAS number: 000074-86-2; 
Formula: C2H2; 
Synonyms: Ethin, ethyne; 
UUID: 1fe91cd9-896a-3865-a49a-4235fbf6f911
production and transport to Switzerland
Location: production in western Europe
Technology: partial oxidation of natural gas. The flue gas is assumed to be cleaned with electrofilters.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: theoretical model 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1fe91cd9-896a-3865-a49a-4235fbf6f911.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
